ADDRESS: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Main_Page
==================================================
If you have a question related to the Main Page, please search the talk page archives first to check if it has previously been addressed:

The  [LINK: (article wizard) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Article_wizard] : to submit an  [LINK: (article) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:What_is_an_article%3F]  or a  [LINK: (redirect) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Redirect]

The  [LINK: (Teahouse) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Teahouse] : to ask your first basic questions about contributing to Wikipedia

The  [LINK: (help desk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Help_desk] : to ask technical questions about using Wikipedia (e.g.  [LINK: (how to edit) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Editing] ,  [LINK: (images) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Files] ,  [LINK: (categories) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Category] )

The  [LINK: (village pump) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Village_pump] : to ask questions about Wikipedia  [LINK: (policies) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:List_of_policies] ,  [LINK: (guidelines) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:List_of_guidelines]  or operations

The  [LINK: (reference desk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Reference_desk] : to ask questions about subjects other than Wikipedia (including topics covered in its articles)

The  [LINK: (administrators' noticeboard) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Administrators%27_noticeboard] : to report a problem (e.g.  [LINK: (vandalism) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Vandalism] )

[LINK: (Question help) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Questions] : to find out more about where to ask questions or make comments on Wikipedia

[LINK: (Main Page errors) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Main_Page/Errors] : to report errors in current or upcoming Main Page content

[LINK: (Today's featured article requests) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today%27s_featured_article/requests] : to suggest a  [LINK: (featured article) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Featured_articles]  for " [LINK: (Today's featured article) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today%27s_featured_article] "

[LINK: (In the news candidates) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news/Candidates] : to nominate an item for " [LINK: (In the news) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:In_the_news] "

[LINK: (Did you know suggestions) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Did_you_know] : to nominate an item for " [LINK: (Did you know) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Did_you_know] "

[LINK: (Selected anniversaries) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Selected_anniversaries] : to add an anniversary to " [LINK: (On this day) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Selected_anniversaries] "

[LINK: (Today's featured list submissions) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today%27s_featured_list/Submissions] : to suggest a  [LINK: (featured list) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Featured_lists]  for " [LINK: (Today's featured list) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Today%27s_featured_list] "

[LINK: (Featured picture candidates) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Featured_picture_candidates] : images appearing as  [LINK: (picture of the day) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Picture_of_the_day]  are selected roughly  [LINK: (according to the order in which they were promoted) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFO_(computing_and_electronics)]  to  [LINK: (featured status) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Featured_pictures]

[LINK: (Wikipedia languages) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template_talk:Wikipedia_languages] : to propose a change to the list of Wikipedias in other languages

[LINK: (Main Page frequently asked questions) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:FAQ/Main_Page] : to learn more about the Main Page

