I have done a last-minute hook rotation and would appreciate editors double-checking the set. In particular, I want to make sure the Roman Polanski hook is OK to run, even with  [LINK: (WP:BLP) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:BLP]  considerations. Also, any help with rotating future OTD sets would be greatly appreciated; editors can ping me or post on my talk page with questions. Thanks,  [LINK: (Z1720) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User:Z1720]  ( [LINK: (talk) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Z1720] )  [LINK: (15:22, 31 January 2026 (UTC)) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Main_Page#c-Z1720-20260131152200-Tomorrow's_OTD] [ [LINK: (reply) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Main_Page] ]


